            "body": "Os: Arch linux\r\nTerminal: Alacritty and tmux\r\n\r\nThe guicursor: \r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.opt.guicursor = \"\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n{\r\n  _info = {\r\n    allows_duplicates = false,\r\n    commalist = true,\r\n    default = \"n-v-c-sm:block,i-ci-ve:ver25,r-cr-o:hor20\",\r\n    flaglist = false,\r\n    global_local = false,\r\n    last_set_chan = -9.2233720368548e+18,\r\n    last_set_linenr = 0,\r\n    last_set_sid = -8,\r\n    metatype = \"array\",\r\n    name = \"guicursor\",\r\n    scope = \"global\",\r\n    shortname = \"gcr\",\r\n    type = \"string\",\r\n    was_set = true\r\n  },\r\n  _name = \"guicursor\",\r\n  _value = \"\",\r\n  <metatable> = <1>{\r\n    __add = <function 1>,\r\n    __index = <table 1>,\r\n    __pow = <function 2>,\r\n    __sub = <function 3>,\r\n    _set = <function 4>,\r\n    append = <function 5>,\r\n    get = <function 6>,\r\n    prepend = <function 7>,\r\n    remove = <function 8>\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n{\r\n  _info = {\r\n    allows_duplicates = false,\r\n    commalist = true,\r\n    default = \"n-v-c-sm:block,i-ci-ve:ver25,r-cr-o:hor20\",\r\n    flaglist = false,\r\n    global_local = false,\r\n    last_set_chan = -9.2233720368548e+18,\r\n    last_set_linenr = 0,\r\n    last_set_sid = -8,\r\n    metatype = \"array\",\r\n    name = \"guicursor\",\r\n    scope = \"global\",\r\n    shortname = \"gcr\",\r\n    type = \"string\",\r\n    was_set = true\r\n  },\r\n  _name = \"guicursor\",\r\n  _value = \"\",\r\n  <metatable> = <1>{\r\n    __add = <function 1>,\r\n    __index = <table 1>,\r\n    __pow = <function 2>,\r\n    __sub = <function 3>,\r\n    _set = <function 4>,\r\n    append = <function 5>,\r\n    get = <function 6>,\r\n    prepend = <function 7>,\r\n    remove = <function 8>\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```",
