            "body": "With some dirty hack taken [from 'folke/noice.nvim'](https://github.com/folke/noice.nvim/blob/448bb9c524a7601035449210838e374a30153172/lua/noice/util/hacks.lua#L176-L178), this should now be resolved on latest `main`. But to reiterate, I don't think using `vim.o.guicursor = ''` as the main option value is a good idea to begin with.",
